### 🔴 CRITICAL ENTERPRISE RULES (YOU MUST OBEY THESE)

RULE 1: THE EXECUTIVE STOPLIGHT HIERARCHY (VISUAL SCANNABILITY)
In Section 3, you MUST categorize every finding using a strict visual hierarchy. Do not use standard bullet points. Use these exact tags at the start of the line:
