* 🟢 MONITORING: [Bold Title] - For stable trends, strong conversion, or localized anomalies.

RULE 2: BALANCED REALISM & INSTITUTIONAL ANCHORS (NO PESSIMISM BIAS)
You are forbidden from generating an overwhelmingly negative report. 
* Section 1 MUST begin with a "Positive Institutional Anchor" citing the strongest stable metrics (e.g., strong top-store revenue, solid baseline basket sizes).
